Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 09:28:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] test(handlers): cover VK ID HTTP endpoints
 (PUT-as-upsert)

Adds transports/bifrost-http/handlers/governance_vk_id_test.go (11
tests) for patch2/vk-id-header's HTTP handler surface:

- POST /api/governance/virtual-keys: server-generated UUID when ID
  omitted; caller-supplied ID honored when provided; with budget on
  caller-supplied ID; validation (missing name -> 400)
- PUT /api/governance/virtual-keys/{vk_id} as upsert:
    - Create branch when ID is unknown (URL's vk_id wins over body)
    - Update branch when ID exists (preserves untouched fields, does
      NOT rotate VK value)
    - Empty vk_id -> 400
    - Body-supplied id field ignored on create branch
    - Idempotent: two PUTs with same ID work as create-then-update
    - Invalid JSON on create branch -> 400
- Full reconcile lifecycle: three PUTs with same deterministic ID
  observe create-update-update; VK value not rotated; reload fires on
  every call
